cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >-
  If you use this software or its outputs, please cite this repository.
  For scientific results derived from the dissertation, please also cite
  the corresponding thesis and/or associated publication.

title: "Bologna Rooftop Solar Potential Mapping with Machine Learning"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Tabatabaei"
    given-names: "Mahdiyeh"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-7219-3525"

abstract: >-
  A reproducible open-data and machine-learning workflow for predicting
  and mapping annual roof-plane solar irradiation in Bologna, Italy.
  The workflow combines geospatial data, urban morphology indicators,
  physics-based irradiation labels, gradient-boosted machine learning,
  spatially aware validation, and SHAP-based explainability.

keywords:
  - rooftop solar potential
  - machine learning
  - urban solar energy
  - geospatial analysis
  - LightGBM
  - SHAP
  - Bologna
  - reproducible research

repository-code: "https://github.com/Mahdiyeh1987/Bologna-rooftop-solar-ml"

url: "https://github.com/Mahdiyeh1987/Bologna-rooftop-solar-ml"

license: MIT
